When changing Whisperwood Vale mechanics, put numbers on DESIGN (or on FISH/BAIT/RODS/MEALS/PERKS/SHOP_CATALOG/SPOTS) in js/config.js. Gameplay code must read DESIGN — do not duplicate the number. The F8 admin Cheats tab and How to play / Progression / Items / Waters / Live check tabs are generated from those tables at runtime; do not maintain parallel lists in js/admin-guide.js. See AGENTS.md.
